":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-05-31T00:23:28Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T20:23:38Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.3 stable, 4.7 beta 4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.3.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9600K CPU @ 3.70GHz (6 threads) - 15.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nAccording to the documentation, ConcavePolygonShape3D is supposed be be hollow and should not detect collision inside it. However, the jolt implementation uses the raycast even-odd rule to test insideness. This contradicts the documentation and is not valid for non-manifold meshes. In godot physics the intersect_point function for concave shapes simply returns false, which I believe is the intended behavior.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun the MRP, \"Inside\" is printed. Switching to Godot Physics results in \"Outside\" being printed as expected.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[convex-hollow.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28430379/convex-hollow.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119903/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119903/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}